  "summary": "I am currently working as a software developer and find it very fulfilling and rewarding. There's no feeling like getting that \"Aha\" moment after banging your head against a wall for hours.\n\nI am a strong proponent of education. There is no doubt in my mind that anybody who is excited enough about a subject can learn about it and become an expert in it themselves. Whenever I am curious about a topic, I like taking the time to learn about it and thinking of creative ways to apply it in everyday use. I am also a strong believer that it is never too late to pursue what you truly enjoy. After working as a process engineer for 9 years, I had the epiphany that it wasn't for me and decided to get a formal education in software development. I am delighted to say that it payed off, because I can genuinely say I'm happy going to work.",
